{
    "title": "Word Madness",
    "description": "Try out this challenging free-to-play word puzzle game.\r\nEnjoying challenging levels with the mixture of scapes design.\r\n\r\nImprove your written and spelling skills while kicking back.\r\n\r\nIn this challenging crossword puzzle game, you will:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Solve Word Puzzles! \ud83e\udde9\r\nSolve crossword puzzles; word find challenges; word swipe scrabbles quests and more challenges for your brain.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddf1 Renovate and Design! \ud83e\uddf1\r\nFix, build, paint and design your farm. Make it unique and make it your own!\r\n\r\nJoin our puzzle adventure and get ready to become a spelling master!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Game Highlights \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\nGameplay - Solve each level by completing a word puzzle by connecting the letters and spelling words that fit perfectly into the crossword puzzle blocks.\r\n\r\nRewards - After you solve each puzzle of words, you'll be rewarded with coins and stars to help you complete missions and restore the farm.\r\nLevels - Every level of this exciting free word game is more challenging than the last so get ready for hours of fun.\r\n\r\nBoosters - If you're ever having trouble solving a word puzzle, tap on the fireworks or hammer to reveal puzzle letters, or blast away an entire word with dynamite. Don't forget that the magic wand is also only a tap away.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy word search games, crossword puzzles, or scrabble, you'll love playing Word Madness.\r\n\r\nPlay Word Madness for a few minutes every day to sharpen your mind \ud83e\udde0 \r\n\r\nDownload and play our Word Madness today!\r\n\r\nWord Madness is free to play, though some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. If you don't want to use this option, simply turn it off in your device's Restrictions menu.\r\n\r\nQuestions? Contact our Tech Support by sending an email to support@wordmadness.club\r\n\r\nWant to enjoy exclusive bonuses? Meet other word puzzle enthusiasts; let's connect!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Try out this challenging free-to-play word puzzle game.<br>Enjoying challenging levels with the mixture of scapes design.<br><br>Improve your written and spelling skills while kicking back.<br><br>In this challenging crossword puzzle game, you will:<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Solve Word Puzzles! \ud83e\udde9<br>Solve crossword puzzles; word find challenges; word swipe scrabbles quests and more challenges for your brain.<br><br>\ud83e\uddf1 Renovate and Design! \ud83e\uddf1<br>Fix, build, paint and design your farm. Make it unique and make it your own!<br><br>Join our puzzle adventure and get ready to become a spelling master!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Game Highlights \ud83c\udf1f<br><br>Gameplay - Solve each level by completing a word puzzle by connecting the letters and spelling words that fit perfectly into the crossword puzzle blocks.<br><br>Rewards - After you solve each puzzle of words, you&#39;ll be rewarded with coins and stars to help you complete missions and restore the farm.<br>Levels - Every level of this exciting free word game is more challenging than the last so get ready for hours of fun.<br><br>Boosters - If you&#39;re ever having trouble solving a word puzzle, tap on the fireworks or hammer to reveal puzzle letters, or blast away an entire word with dynamite. Don&#39;t forget that the magic wand is also only a tap away.<br><br>If you enjoy word search games, crossword puzzles, or scrabble, you&#39;ll love playing Word Madness.<br><br>Play Word Madness for a few minutes every day to sharpen your mind \ud83e\udde0 <br><br>Download and play our Word Madness today!<br><br>Word Madness is free to play, though some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. If you don&#39;t want to use this option, simply turn it off in your device&#39;s Restrictions menu.<br><br>Questions? Contact our Tech Support by sending an email to support@wordmadness.club<br><br>Want to enjoy exclusive bonuses? Meet other word puzzle enthusiasts; let&#39;s connect!",
